forms 1
# The part's instructions as the cell's probes read them back: one line a form, an operation and
# the kind and mark of each printed operand, with the encoding the form was first seen with and
# the instruction it was seen as. The format is the comment at the head of sass_machine.h.
part sm_86
form IADD register,register,register,register,register 0x0000000700077210 0x004fca0007ffe0ff 0:18-18;1:24-27;2:32-34;3:63-63;4:72-72 IADD R1, R0, R7, R0, R0
